{"id":"a11f0e3e49cef083","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-circuit-sat.md","title":"CIRCUIT-SAT","display":"df-circuit-sat — CIRCUIT-SAT","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-circuit-sat","aliases":["28-df-circuit-sat","CIRCUIT-SAT"],"display":"df-circuit-sat — CIRCUIT-SAT","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.9","source_printed_pages":"110–111","source_pdf_pages":"136–137","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-circuit-sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-circuit-sat</span><span>CIRCUIT-SAT</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-circuit-sat — CIRCUIT-SAT"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"110–111"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"136–137"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_C\">\\(\\operatorname{out}_C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a> 中逐字段构造的单射编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 随电路实例取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\exists x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle1\\rangle]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\exists x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle1\\rangle]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>非法编码不在语言中。证书是使电路输出一的输入赋值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.9，印刷页 110–111；PDF 页 136–137。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R7复核：Definition 6.9（PDF136–137）的复杂度解释使用标准有限图表示；仅可计算单射不足以固定NP完全性所需输入长度关系，故在前提中明确编解码和长度条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}$、$\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}$ 采用 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]] 中逐字段构造的单射编码；$n$ 随电路实例取值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CIRCUITSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ [C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\exists x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle1\\rangle]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1458,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"电路问题与函数：[[28-df-circuit-sat]]、[[28-thm-circuit-sat-np-complete]]、[[28-df-majority-function]]。"},{"id":"048daeb639b8a67f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d"]}